;), once named the most beautiful square of the Netherlands.\" data-attachment-id=\"3883\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Built in the 11th century, the Basilica of Our Lady (or &lt;i&gt;Onze-Lieve-Vrouwebasiliek&lt;\/i&gt;) is known for its statue of Our Lady, Star of the Sea. It is located on Our Dear Lady Square (&lt;i&gt;Onze Lieve Vrouweplein&lt;\/i&gt;), once named the most beautiful square of the Netherlands.\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2019\/01\/20190102_141940\/1208809797.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">Built in the 11th century, the Basilica of Our Lady (or <i>Onze-Lieve-Vrouwebasiliek<\/i>) is known for its statue of Our Lady, Star of the Sea. It is located on Our Dear Lady Square (<i>Onze Lieve Vrouweplein<\/i>), once named the most beautiful square of the Netherlands.<\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/DSC_4605.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"The Derlon Hotel Maastricht, located right next to the Basilica is said to be the only 5 star hotel in Maastricht even though it has actually only been awarded four stars. The reason why it was never awarded five stars is because it does not have a pool. In protest, it placed the city&#039;s crest in the middle of its four stars, making it look like it is actually a five-star hotel.\" data-attachment-id=\"3862\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><